      "content": "okay thanks. i have sumatriptan here, i usually take 50mg but this feels crazy intense. do you think it's safe if i just take 200mg all at once to try and knock it out fast? i also kinda feel like my face is getting numb on that same side, does that happen with auras too? i'd rather just sleep it off than deal with a hospital if i can help it.",
